# PV1_0 = 1 (fiducial offset requested) with PV1_1 = phi_0 = 30 but NO
# PV1_2. wcslib prjoff applies no offset unless BOTH PV1_1 and PV1_2 are
# given (it resets phi0/theta0 to the projection defaults and x0 = y0 = 0),
# while celset still uses the user's phi_0 for the native pole. Synthetic.
NOTE pipeline: PV1_0 = 1 with PV1_1 only: no offset, phi_0 kept for the pole
GRID 1 512 9 1 512 9
PIX 256.5 256.5
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 512
NAXIS2  = 512
CTYPE1  = 'RA---CAR'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--CAR'
CRVAL1  = 40.0
CRVAL2  = 25.0
CRPIX1  = 256.5
CRPIX2  = 256.5
CDELT1  = -0.1
CDELT2  = 0.1
PV1_0   = 1.0
PV1_1   = 30.0
